            <span class="related-desc">How assets are split in a UAE divorce</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/wife-rights-after-divorce-uae/" class="related-card">
            <span class="related-title">Wife's Rights After Divorce</span>
            <span class="related-desc">All financial entitlements in one guide</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/iddah-waiting-period-uae/" class="related-card">
